🟠 api in shop (prod-eu-1) keeps running out of memory because its memory limit is too low for normal use. It was killed within 10 seconds of starting. Two restarts since its pod was created about one hour ago. Fix: raise the memory limit of container app in deployment/api above 256Mi. To read the output of the last crash, run kubectl logs deploy/api -c app -n shop --previous
Proof: both replicas fail, on 2 nodes.
